									<p>Reflection pools and indoor water fountains are wonderful ways to add ambiance and elegance to all kinds of spaces. Whether you are talking about a luxury hotel, an airport concourse, a commercial building, a casino lobby or a private home, adding a fountain means bringing the beauty and sounds of nature right to the place where you work or live. Likewise, installing a reflection pool gives you the sweet serenity of shallow, undisturbed water, even indoors. Because of this, the two features often go together  particularly in loud or high-traffic areas where they can counterbalance the noise. At Midwest Tropical, many of our fountains include a reflecting pool design, which allows falling water to gracefully pour from the fountain into the larger, serene pool that makes the entire water feature even more enticing and enchanting. To give you the best in reflecting pools and fountains, we are proud to offer the option to custom-design your water features to perfectly complete the overall look of your environment. Talk to our professionals about creating a one-of-a-kind focal point that caters to your environment.</p><h2>Custom Reflection Pools And Fountains From Midwest Tropical</h2><p>Calm and soothing, custom fountains and reflection pools nicely counteract high-traffic areas in offices, resorts, transportation facilities, casinos and more. When you place one between a property entrance and an architectural feature or visual focal point, the water fountain becomes a way to add impressive visual drama. With this in mind, Midwest Tropical custom-creates reflecting pools and fountains for businesses and residences around the country. Because we design and build each unit individually, our custom indoor water features can come in any shape imaginable. Whether you want to line your wall with a reflection pool and fountain or wish to create a focal point at your facility, our team can do it. Thanks to the peaceful impact of our reflecting pools, you cant go wrong adding one to your space. To further enhance their appeal, many of our designs combine a reflection pool with another of our water features  such as a cascading fountain, tranquil rain curtain or unique <a href="/waterwalls/">Aquafall Water Wall</a>. No matter which design you choose, adding a reflection pool can create the ultimate  factor. </p>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
